### Benchmarks

As a baseline to compare `xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection` against, we have used the Python [langid](https://github.com/saffsd/langid.py) library. 
Since it comes pre-trained on 97 languages, we have used its `.set_languages()` method to constrain the language set to our 20 languages. The average accuracy 
of langid on the test set is **98.5%**. More details are provided by the table below.

